1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,820
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:19,530
[Twenty-three years ago]

3
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:39,240
Dad!

4
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:41,790
Dad!

5
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:42,640
Let me go!

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,170
I can definitely get the money!

7
00:00:44,170 --> 00:00:45,320
I can definitely get the money!

8
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:46,150
Cao San.

9
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:48,000
You can never get the money.

10
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,200
I'm helping you.

11
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:51,880
Every trade

12
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,390
has its own rules.

13
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:54,710
You can only

14
00:00:55,030 --> 00:00:57,500
get the money more easily if you're crippled.

15
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,040
You're actually not willing?

16
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,920
So many people out there are begging me for this.

17
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,870
I wish you prosperity

18
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:07,760
and wealth!

19
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,039
May your house be filled with gold and silver!

20
00:01:10,039 --> 00:01:12,200
May you have a happy life!

21
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,680
A happy life!

22
00:01:15,330 --> 00:01:16,250
How is it?

23
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,130
Leader.

24
00:01:17,230 --> 00:01:18,960
The lamb spine is almost ready.

25
00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:30,700
It's rare to see such a handsome face.

26
00:01:31,590 --> 00:01:33,229
Let him sell his body.

27
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:35,310
Thank you, Leader.

28
00:01:35,870 --> 00:01:37,150
Thank you, Leader.

29
00:03:19,410 --> 00:03:23,250
[A Prophet]

30
00:03:23,970 --> 00:03:26,390
[Episode 14]

31
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,680
Miss Jiang?

32
00:04:19,430 --> 00:04:20,360
Mr. Cao.

33
00:04:20,670 --> 00:04:22,000
What are you doing here?

34
00:04:22,100 --> 00:04:23,200
Don't even mention it.

35
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:25,480
My General Longxiang ran in through there,

36
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,430
through this crack.

37
00:04:27,450 --> 00:04:28,690
Can you...

38
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:32,610
But this is the Master's room.

39
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:34,430
It's not convenient to disturb him.

40
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:36,090
I'll just go in and take a look.

41
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:38,070
The General helped you get revenge after all,

42
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:38,820
didn't he?

43
00:04:40,990 --> 00:04:41,950
Then I'll give it a try.

44
00:04:41,950 --> 00:04:42,580
Try it.

45
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:53,460
Master.

46
00:04:53,990 --> 00:04:55,190
Sorry to disturb you.

47
00:04:55,260 --> 00:04:57,220
This is Mr. Cao.

48
00:04:57,580 --> 00:04:58,990
His cricket ran in.

49
00:04:59,100 --> 00:05:01,180
Can you let him in to take a look?

50
00:05:04,340 --> 00:05:06,000
Sorry to disturb you, Master.

51
00:05:06,580 --> 00:05:07,340
It's fine.

52
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:09,350
Please come in, Mr. Cao.

53
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:26,990
Mr. Cao,

54
00:05:27,010 --> 00:05:28,210
please find it as soon as possible.

55
00:05:28,210 --> 00:05:29,650
The Master needs to rest.

56
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:30,750
Okay.

57
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:40,659
Isn't it right there?

58
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:42,250
Where?

59
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,360
Mr. Cao...

60
00:05:51,550 --> 00:05:53,350
How did you step on it and kill it?

61
00:05:53,380 --> 00:05:54,990
I'm really sorry, Mr. Cao.

62
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:56,620
I was too careless and...

63
00:05:57,110 --> 00:05:58,110
It's all my fault.

64
00:05:58,220 --> 00:05:59,080
How about this?

65
00:05:59,310 --> 00:06:00,460
I'll compensate you with 10 of them.

66
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:01,990
What are you talking about?

67
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:02,700
Even if you compensate me with a hundred,

68
00:06:02,700 --> 00:06:04,430
it can't compare to my General.

69
00:06:05,220 --> 00:06:06,990
Immeasurable blessings.

70
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,840
What a sin.

71
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:10,110
This little thing

72
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:12,020
shouldn't have died here today.

73
00:06:12,340 --> 00:06:14,630
Then let me meddle in this business

74
00:06:15,930 --> 00:06:16,980
and save its life.

75
00:06:18,870 --> 00:06:19,550
You?

76
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:25,140
Can it still be saved?

77
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:50,690
It...

78
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,870
It really came back to life!

79
00:06:53,460 --> 00:06:55,260
Master, you're indeed amazing.

80
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,710
Master, you are truly a god.

81
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:58,840
I was just wondering

82
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:01,240
why the room was glowing with golden light.

83
00:07:03,780 --> 00:07:04,670
Mr. Cao.

84
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:07,140
What else did you see?

85
00:07:08,630 --> 00:07:09,020
Oh, right.

86
00:07:09,020 --> 00:07:10,070
I also saw

87
00:07:10,950 --> 00:07:11,950
that sofa...

88
00:07:13,340 --> 00:07:14,750
It was golden,

89
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:17,200
and there were dragons coiling on it.

90
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:18,220
Just like...

91
00:07:18,780 --> 00:07:20,440
the thing the Emperor sits on—

92
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,740
the Dragon Throne.

93
00:07:25,430 --> 00:07:26,140
Sir.

94
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:28,280
What you see may not be real.

95
00:07:28,310 --> 00:07:29,680
What you see may be real.

96
00:07:30,110 --> 00:07:31,990
If you glimpse the hidden mysteries,

97
00:07:31,990 --> 00:07:33,140
the hidden dragon...

98
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:34,340
will reveal itself.

99
00:07:36,340 --> 00:07:37,310
Miss Jiang.

100
00:07:37,550 --> 00:07:39,030
Please tell the Fifth Master

101
00:07:39,030 --> 00:07:40,340
that things have come to this,

102
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:42,380
and we can only let nature take its course.

103
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:44,630
I can't be of any help.

104
00:07:44,870 --> 00:07:46,130
I'll take my leave now.

105
00:07:46,260 --> 00:07:47,340
Thank you, Master.

106
00:07:47,630 --> 00:07:49,140
I have prepared some humble gifts

107
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:51,260
and had them sent to Yunhe Temple.

108
00:07:51,550 --> 00:07:52,920
Next time I have the chance,

109
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:55,050
I will definitely visit you in person.

110
00:08:05,110 --> 00:08:06,310
He really is a master.

111
00:08:10,190 --> 00:08:11,310
You have no idea.

112
00:08:11,580 --> 00:08:13,310
That jar was smashed to pieces.

113
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:14,900
The Second Master looked at me

114
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:15,900
like he wanted to kill me.

115
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:16,900
I'm telling you,

116
00:08:17,110 --> 00:08:18,430
I can't go back to the gang.

117
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:18,780
I...

118
00:08:18,990 --> 00:08:19,780
Big Teapot!

119
00:08:19,990 --> 00:08:20,310
Second Master.

120
00:08:20,310 --> 00:08:22,460
Do you know how much my Xuande Jar is worth?

121
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:24,720
I've shown you more than enough respect!

122
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:26,930
I'll pay for it.

123
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:29,630
You'll pay?

124
00:08:30,110 --> 00:08:31,430
With what? Your life?

125
00:08:32,950 --> 00:08:34,250
I'm telling you, Shangguan Chengming,

126
00:08:34,250 --> 00:08:36,250
you won't get any money from Cao San.

127
00:08:36,429 --> 00:08:37,289
Do you know him?

128
00:08:37,429 --> 00:08:38,610
He bought a fake antique before,

129
00:08:38,610 --> 00:08:40,909
and he immediately turned those scammers into human-like animals.

130
00:08:40,909 --> 00:08:41,700
Now when he buys things,

131
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:42,860
he has someone appraise them.

132
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:44,230
Do you really think he's stupid?

133
00:08:44,230 --> 00:08:45,830
You can't pull off this scam!

134
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:47,840
Isn't this exactly what you want?

135
00:08:48,070 --> 00:08:50,100
Why don't you hold back a little longer,

136
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:51,620
wait for Cao San to deal with me,

137
00:08:51,620 --> 00:08:52,680
and enjoy the show?

138
00:08:56,460 --> 00:08:57,100
Fine.

139
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:00,220
Let's wait and see.

140
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:07,500
Are you okay?

141
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:08,150
I'm fine.

142
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:10,390
I had to take this kick sooner or later.

143
00:09:10,390 --> 00:09:12,390
At least I can go back to the gang now.

144
00:09:24,490 --> 00:09:25,300
San.

145
00:09:26,310 --> 00:09:27,340
Am I pretty?

146
00:09:31,820 --> 00:09:33,580
Are you shaking your head or nodding?

147
00:09:33,580 --> 00:09:34,580
What do you mean?

148
00:09:34,790 --> 00:09:36,390
I got a stiff neck last night.

149
00:09:37,670 --> 00:09:38,740
My neck is stiff.

150
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:42,070
Your neck is the only stiff thing about you.

151
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:43,340
Let's go.

152
00:09:54,460 --> 00:09:55,870
So pretty!

153
00:09:56,050 --> 00:09:57,260
Take a look from here.

154
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:05,950
Alright.

155
00:10:05,950 --> 00:10:07,280
This one is pretty good.

156
00:10:09,860 --> 00:10:10,820
Mr. Cao?

157
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,670
Isn't this Miss Jiang?

158
00:10:15,030 --> 00:10:15,860
Mr. Cao.

159
00:10:16,310 --> 00:10:17,510
What brings you here?

160
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:18,270
I...

161
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:21,430
I wanted to pick out a gift for you

162
00:10:21,430 --> 00:10:22,700
to thank you.

163
00:10:22,700 --> 00:10:24,100
I'll pick a dress for you.

164
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:25,870
You are too polite, Mr. Cao.

165
00:10:26,100 --> 00:10:27,900
I should be the one thanking you.

166
00:10:27,950 --> 00:10:29,680
If it weren't for your General,

167
00:10:29,950 --> 00:10:31,500
I wouldn't have been able to vent my anger.

168
00:10:31,500 --> 00:10:32,270
Look.

169
00:10:32,270 --> 00:10:33,790
You're the one being too polite.

170
00:10:33,790 --> 00:10:35,320
Well, it's perfect timing.

171
00:10:35,390 --> 00:10:36,700
Mr. Cao, take a look.

172
00:10:37,340 --> 00:10:39,150
Does this dress look good on me?

173
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:40,700
Let me see.

174
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:43,980
What fabric is this?

175
00:10:44,150 --> 00:10:45,820
Why does it feel so good?

176
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:48,340
What feels so good?

177
00:10:49,510 --> 00:10:50,540
I didn't!

178
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:51,980
What didn't you do?

179
00:10:54,310 --> 00:10:55,950
I just heard you say

180
00:10:55,980 --> 00:10:59,170
you wanted to give a gift to a Miss Jiang.

181
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,790
Who is Miss Jiang?

182
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:04,690
Miss Jiang, please excuse us.

183
00:11:04,860 --> 00:11:06,860
This is my wife.

184
00:11:07,190 --> 00:11:07,700
Honey,

185
00:11:07,740 --> 00:11:09,150
this is Miss Jiang.

186
00:11:09,190 --> 00:11:10,580
The gold bars we won

187
00:11:10,580 --> 00:11:12,190
are all thanks to Miss Jiang!

188
00:11:12,820 --> 00:11:14,030
So it's you, Mrs. Cao.

189
00:11:21,170 --> 00:11:23,020
Are you guys doing wholesale?

190
00:11:24,820 --> 00:11:25,860
What a coincidence.

191
00:11:25,860 --> 00:11:27,660
You even got the same one as mine.

192
00:11:27,820 --> 00:11:28,580
San,

193
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:30,700
between the two of us,

194
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:32,430
who looks better in this dress?

195
00:11:34,190 --> 00:11:36,220
If you ask me...

196
00:11:37,620 --> 00:11:38,950
If you ask me,

197
00:11:39,070 --> 00:11:40,190
it's really hard...

198
00:11:40,190 --> 00:11:41,430
to tell.

199
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:44,340
You're so sweet today.

200
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:47,010
Since it's such a coincidence,

201
00:11:47,010 --> 00:11:48,080
how about this?

202
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:51,290
Put everything Mrs. Cao takes a fancy to today

203
00:11:51,740 --> 00:11:52,790
on my tab.

204
00:11:52,990 --> 00:11:54,790
No, no, this isn't appropriate.

205
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:57,150
What's wrong with it?

206
00:11:57,990 --> 00:11:59,790
Since Miss Jiang is so generous,

207
00:12:00,030 --> 00:12:02,030
I'll gladly accept.

208
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:03,820
Let's go take a look.

209
00:12:04,100 --> 00:12:05,270
Come on, make way.

210
00:12:08,190 --> 00:12:10,100
This pattern is also nice.

211
00:12:11,390 --> 00:12:13,150
This one with a bit of fur is quite good.

212
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:13,910
Take a look at this one.

213
00:12:13,910 --> 00:12:14,910
This one...

214
00:12:15,190 --> 00:12:15,670
No.

215
00:12:15,730 --> 00:12:17,460
As for the ones in other colors...

216
00:12:17,460 --> 00:12:19,460
I think they all suit me pretty well.

217
00:12:20,220 --> 00:12:21,220
What do you think?

218
00:12:21,310 --> 00:12:23,150
Wrap them all up for Mrs. Cao.

219
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:25,220
Really?

220
00:12:25,370 --> 00:12:27,890
Miss Jiang, you're so generous!

221
00:12:28,190 --> 00:12:29,660
Let's go. I'll pay.

222
00:12:30,260 --> 00:12:31,260
Thank you, Madam.

223
00:12:31,630 --> 00:12:33,360
Thank you for your generosity.

224
00:12:45,700 --> 00:12:46,950
You bastard.

225
00:12:46,980 --> 00:12:48,390
Whenever you see a vixen,

226
00:12:48,980 --> 00:12:51,340
you can't take your eyes off her.

227
00:12:51,910 --> 00:12:52,500
Honey,

228
00:12:52,670 --> 00:12:54,790
this lady is from the north.

229
00:12:55,070 --> 00:12:56,580
She has powerful connections.

230
00:12:56,580 --> 00:12:57,790
We should get along with her.

231
00:12:57,790 --> 00:12:59,030
Why do I feel like

232
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:01,640
if she gives me one yuan today,

233
00:13:01,820 --> 00:13:04,620
she'll trick you out of 10 yuan tomorrow?

234
00:13:04,650 --> 00:13:06,100
Don't you think so?

235
00:13:06,540 --> 00:13:07,460
Blockhead.

236
00:13:07,740 --> 00:13:08,500
Honey.

237
00:13:09,910 --> 00:13:10,620
I am

238
00:13:10,860 --> 00:13:12,700
the smartest person in the world.

239
00:13:12,700 --> 00:13:13,460
Remember,

240
00:13:13,580 --> 00:13:16,310
you're the most blockheaded person in the world.

241
00:13:31,220 --> 00:13:32,550
What do you say, Eunuch?

242
00:13:32,860 --> 00:13:34,030
Is this real or fake?

243
00:13:34,460 --> 00:13:35,460
It can't be fake.

244
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:36,700
In the palace,

245
00:13:36,700 --> 00:13:37,790
I've handled this treasure

246
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:40,500
so many times.

247
00:13:40,860 --> 00:13:41,790
It's absolutely real.

248
00:13:41,790 --> 00:13:43,050
My eyes can't be wrong.

249
00:13:43,220 --> 00:13:44,390
See?

250
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:46,470
What did I say?

251
00:13:46,820 --> 00:13:48,680
I just need to stay clear-minded.

252
00:13:49,070 --> 00:13:50,500
That's hard to say.

253
00:13:51,550 --> 00:13:53,460
The thing can be real,

254
00:13:53,700 --> 00:13:54,950
but this person...

255
00:13:55,390 --> 00:13:56,820
may not be.

256
00:13:57,170 --> 00:13:58,170
It sounds like

257
00:13:58,190 --> 00:14:00,240
you know the tricks of the trade.

258
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:01,860
Tell us about them.

259
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:03,740
Let me tell you.

260
00:14:04,340 --> 00:14:06,430
When the Empress Dowager was buried,

261
00:14:06,550 --> 00:14:09,030
there were countless treasures.

262
00:14:09,860 --> 00:14:12,700
The Xuande Jar was one of them.

263
00:14:13,150 --> 00:14:14,220
But later,

264
00:14:15,100 --> 00:14:17,300
the Empress Dowager's tomb was robbed.

265
00:14:17,910 --> 00:14:19,790
The person holding it

266
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:22,740
may not be a prince.

267
00:14:24,700 --> 00:14:25,740
Did you hear that?

268
00:14:25,910 --> 00:14:27,820
Those people are all scammers.

269
00:14:27,910 --> 00:14:29,040
Alright, scammers.

270
00:14:29,070 --> 00:14:30,150
Did she scam my money?

271
00:14:30,150 --> 00:14:31,500
We even won some money.

272
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:33,430
Do you remember those gold bars we won?

273
00:14:33,430 --> 00:14:35,580
They're all real gold.

274
00:14:35,610 --> 00:14:37,700
If they hadn't given you a little taste of the benefits,

275
00:14:37,700 --> 00:14:39,220
how could you have fallen for it?

276
00:14:39,220 --> 00:14:40,100
Exactly.

277
00:14:40,580 --> 00:14:43,500
This scam is called the Golden Hook.

278
00:14:43,980 --> 00:14:45,100
Golden Hook?

279
00:14:45,270 --> 00:14:45,980
Leader.

280
00:14:46,700 --> 00:14:49,430
She didn't mention money to you this time, right?

281
00:14:49,860 --> 00:14:52,270
Next time, she'll pull the hook back.

282
00:14:58,430 --> 00:14:59,580
I'm not stupid.

283
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:01,660
If she uses the Golden Fork on me, I...

284
00:15:01,660 --> 00:15:03,230
Golden Hook.

285
00:15:04,100 --> 00:15:05,190
She dares to use a hook on me?

286
00:15:05,190 --> 00:15:05,910
If she does that,

287
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:07,570
I'll turn her into a human dog!

288
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:16,940
♪ In spring, the wind blows and all things grow ♪

289
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:26,440
♪ Flowers are red, leaves are green, and grass is fresh ♪

290
00:16:29,860 --> 00:16:31,390
The sun is almost setting.

291
