00:47:27,490 --> 00:47:28,460
With you as my husband,

874
00:47:28,460 --> 00:47:29,680
I can never be the Empress!

875
00:47:29,680 --> 00:47:30,580
I can only be a tough wife!

876
00:47:30,580 --> 00:47:31,350
Kneel!

877
00:47:32,700 --> 00:47:33,140
Honey.

878
00:47:33,980 --> 00:47:35,710
Do you really think I'm stupid?

879
00:47:35,980 --> 00:47:36,940
Let me tell you,

880
00:47:36,960 --> 00:47:38,180
I've been completely clear-headed

881
00:47:38,180 --> 00:47:39,620
from the very beginning.

882
00:47:40,060 --> 00:47:41,710
Did we spend a single penny?

883
00:47:41,750 --> 00:47:43,020
We didn't spend a penny

884
00:47:43,020 --> 00:47:44,660
and got so many treasures for free.

885
00:47:44,660 --> 00:47:46,660
Haven't they been looking for some

886
00:47:46,690 --> 00:47:48,210
true dragon?

887
00:47:48,270 --> 00:47:49,790
Don't they love acting?

888
00:47:49,790 --> 00:47:51,660
I've just been playing along with them.

889
00:47:51,660 --> 00:47:52,790
Actually, I'm the one

890
00:47:52,790 --> 00:47:54,230
playing them for fools.

891
00:47:56,090 --> 00:47:57,930
What should I say to you?

892
00:47:58,390 --> 00:47:59,910
In this world,

893
00:48:00,450 --> 00:48:02,100
free things

894
00:48:02,350 --> 00:48:04,310
are the most expensive.

895
00:48:05,310 --> 00:48:07,870
Those people are probably all scammers.

896
00:48:08,100 --> 00:48:10,020
The junk they gave you

897
00:48:10,350 --> 00:48:11,750
is probably all fake.

898
00:48:11,750 --> 00:48:13,480
Do you understand, blockhead?

899
00:48:13,840 --> 00:48:14,760
It's fake.

900
00:48:15,420 --> 00:48:17,230
There's no such thing in the palace.

901
00:48:17,230 --> 00:48:18,230
Jerks.

902
00:48:18,950 --> 00:48:20,750
I knew these people

903
00:48:20,750 --> 00:48:21,950
were up to no good.

904
00:48:22,790 --> 00:48:23,660
Madam,

905
00:48:23,870 --> 00:48:25,980
what else did they show you?

906
00:48:26,000 --> 00:48:27,130
What else is there to see?

907
00:48:27,130 --> 00:48:28,730
Isn't it just a bunch of junk?

908
00:48:33,470 --> 00:48:34,550
By the way, Eunuch,

909
00:48:35,270 --> 00:48:36,540
there's one more thing

910
00:48:36,890 --> 00:48:39,600
that I'm afraid even you haven't seen.

911
00:48:40,680 --> 00:48:41,760
What is it?

912
00:48:42,500 --> 00:48:43,830
The Dragon Throne.

913
00:48:44,790 --> 00:48:46,230
The Dragon Throne?

914
00:48:47,430 --> 00:48:49,490
This is the biggest joke in the world.

915
00:48:49,520 --> 00:48:50,690
The Dragon Throne

916
00:48:50,720 --> 00:48:53,550
is in the Palace Museum in Peiping.

917
00:48:54,790 --> 00:48:55,580
Right.

918
00:48:56,100 --> 00:48:57,090
If the Dragon Throne

919
00:48:57,090 --> 00:48:59,190
is in the Palace Museum in Peiping,

920
00:48:59,620 --> 00:49:01,790
then what did I see?

921
00:49:02,470 --> 00:49:03,240
Eunuch.

922
00:49:04,350 --> 00:49:05,100
Have...

923
00:49:05,820 --> 00:49:08,930
Have you really seen the Dragon Throne?

924
00:49:09,140 --> 00:49:11,180
Of course I have.

925
00:49:11,420 --> 00:49:15,100
I've even seen the crack the little emperor

926
00:49:15,230 --> 00:49:16,420
kicked into it.

927
00:49:16,440 --> 00:49:18,660
That little emperor was quite naughty,

928
00:49:18,750 --> 00:49:20,750
putting a crack in the Dragon Throne.

929
00:49:20,750 --> 00:49:22,190
When we were in the palace

930
00:49:22,390 --> 00:49:23,180
serving our masters,

931
00:49:23,180 --> 00:49:25,540
we weren't allowed to look them in the eye.

932
00:49:25,830 --> 00:49:28,360
So I looked at this Dragon Throne for 20 years.

933
00:49:28,540 --> 00:49:31,310
Who could know better than I do if it's real or fake?

934
00:49:31,310 --> 00:49:33,310
If that's the case, Eunuch,

935
00:49:33,690 --> 00:49:36,210
I'll have to ask you for a favor

936
00:49:36,540 --> 00:49:37,670
and come with me.

937
00:49:37,870 --> 00:49:38,390
Okay.

938
00:49:38,420 --> 00:49:39,150
Come on.

939
00:49:39,200 --> 00:49:40,320
Thank you.

940
00:49:43,400 --> 00:49:45,570
[In the next episode]

941
00:49:45,710 --> 00:49:46,790
What exactly happened?

942
00:49:46,790 --> 00:49:47,900
A few men suddenly rushed in

943
00:49:47,900 --> 00:49:48,880
and started shooting!

944
00:49:48,880 --> 00:49:49,960
They seemed to be Japanese!

945
00:49:49,960 --> 00:49:51,930
He is the Eastern Divine Dragon!

946
00:49:51,950 --> 00:49:53,550
Hurry! Protect the Emperor!

947
00:49:53,560 --> 00:49:54,480
My beloved!

948
00:49:54,540 --> 00:49:55,730
The assassination attempt means

949
00:49:55,730 --> 00:49:58,040
Your Majesty's identity and whereabouts have been exposed!

950
00:49:58,040 --> 00:49:59,160
The most important thing right now

951
00:49:59,160 --> 00:50:01,160
is to move you to a safe place.

952
00:50:01,310 --> 00:50:03,570
Your Majesty, the train leaves tonight.

953
00:50:03,880 --> 00:50:06,570
I'll go with Fifth Master to arrange your itinerary.

954
00:50:06,570 --> 00:50:07,570
Wait.
